CLI.md §3.5, EVALUATION.md §1, TYPES.md §1: a test with a static error does not run and fails,
listing the static errors inside it; the other tests run.
-- args --
test
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

test "broken" {
  expect nothing == 1
}

test "fine" {
  expect true
}
-- want --
[exit 1]
[stdout]
error[E3008]  a/a.canon:5:10
  cannot infer the type of this expression; add a type

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)

FAIL  a/a.canon:4  broken
  a/a.canon:5  error[E3008]  cannot infer the type of this expression; add a type

1 passed, 1 failed (…)
[stderr]
